Official BLAKE3 C implementation, vendored unchanged from
https://github.com/BLAKE3-team/BLAKE3 at tag 1.8.2 (see LICENSE).

ecopy additions:
  - blake3_wrapper.c: one-shot blake3_hash() and a backend-name query for the
    final report. blake3.h declares these two helpers; nothing else is edited.

The x86 SIMD files are each compiled with their own ISA flags (see Makefile);
blake3_dispatch.c picks the fastest supported one at runtime, and
blake3_portable.c is always linked as the fallback. Non-x86 builds use the
portable backend only.
